urce_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V Corollary3.2.6, print355/PDF367; explicit two-round specialization"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source corollary and two-round type specialization checked; full extraction proof inherited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>θ、ζ、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NCI}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{NCI}_2\\)</span> 及四个数变量取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f7971a17cbe9e6d\" href=\"?note=7f7971a17cbe9e6d\" title=\"72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation\">72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA_0\">\\(PA_0\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95251f310e95be8e\" href=\"?note=95251f310e95be8e\" title=\"72-thm-functional-interpretation\">72-thm-functional-interpretation</a> 的指定基本算术呈现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PA_0\\vdash\\forall x_0\\exists y_0\\forall x_1\\exists y_1\\theta\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists F_0,F_1\\in\\mathcal T_\\zeta^c\\\n\\operatorname{NCI}_2(\\theta,F_0,F_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PA_0\\vdash\\forall x_0\\exists y_0\\forall x_1\\exists y_1\\theta\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists F_0,F_1\\in\\mathcal T_\\zeta^c\\\n\\operatorname{NCI}_2(\\theta,F_0,F_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary3.2.6 在 n=2 且数变量、无量词基本算术矩阵时的明确类型实例。输入四变量交替句，输出两个封闭高型 System T 项，对任意 a,h 都在 T₀ 证明反例策略被击败的矩阵。一般证明经过负翻译与 Dialectica 重新排列挑战参数；本轮核对来源陈述及类型对应，未独立复写其完整一般翻译归约。因此继承上游解释定理的证明限制，未声称给出了机器证明提取器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"7f7971a17cbe9e6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-functional-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"95251f310e95be8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-functional-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"7f7971a17cbe9e6d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"θ、ζ、$\\operatorname{NCI}_2$ 及四个数变量取 [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]]；$PA_0$ 为 [[72-thm-functional-interpretation]] 的指定基本算术呈现。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-functional-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"95251f310e95be8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"θ、ζ、$\\operatorname{NCI}_2$ 及四个数变量取 [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]]；$PA_0$ 为 [[72-thm-functional-interpretation]] 的指定基本算术呈现。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{NCI}_2","display":false},{"tex":"PA_0","display":false},{"tex":"PA_0\\vdash\\forall x_0\\exists y_0\\forall x_1\\exists y_1\\theta\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists F_0,F_1\\in\\mathcal T_\\zeta^c\\\n\\operatorname{NCI}_2(\\theta,F_0,F_1).","display":true}],"bytes":1804,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]